BT 1 0 0 1 2 121.2 Tm /F3 7.6 Tf 9.2 TL (Goal: low-fidelity responsive wireframes and a documented variant decision) Tj T* (Audience: Adults using a community wellness service, including users with varied digital confidence and) Tj T* (  accessibility needs.) Tj T* (Context: Generate a four-screen wellness booking flow, then compare two structurally different directions.) Tj T* (Required content: Use realistic service names, appointment times, success, empty, loading, permission and) Tj T* (  error states.) Tj T* (Design system: Use the supplied tokens and component rules. Prefer clear labels, visible focus, 44px minimum) Tj T* (  targets and strong contrast.) Tj T* (Constraints: Mobile-first; no lorem ipsum; one dominant primary action per screen; preserve user input on) Tj T* (  recoverable errors.) Tj T* (Acceptance: All required screens appear; Real content replaces lorem ipsum; Variants differ structurally;) Tj T* (  Selection cites criteria) Tj T* (Output: Create the named design in Claude Design, save a version checkpoint and export or share the evidence) Tj T* (  requested in the README.) Tj T* ET
